{
  "_readme": [
    "Khalty's questionnaire. The app reads this file at startup and checks it; a mistake shows an error naming the exact place.",
    "Texts: every text has \"en\" and \"ar\". A language can be one text, or {\"male\": ..., \"female\": ...} chosen by the USER's gender.",
    "Placeholders in {curly braces} are filled in by the app: {name}, {detected} (country from the phone), {residence} (country they live in).",
    "Option \"id\"s are saved in users' answers: never change or reuse an id once it is live. Labels can be reworded at any time.",
    "\"if\" asks a question only when an earlier answer matches (by option id); otherwise \"else_value\" / \"else_from\" is used, or it is skipped.",
    "\"visibility\": \"card\" = matches may see it; \"khalty\" = private, never shown on the card.",
    "\"needs_review\": [\"ar\"] = the Arabic still needs review by a native speaker."
  ],
  "schema_version": 2,
  "chapters": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": {
        "en": "About you",
        "ar": "عنك"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": {
        "en": "Faith",
        "ar": "الدين"
      },
      "intro": {
        "en": "Now a few questions about faith 🌙 There are no wrong answers.",
        "ar": "والآن أسئلة قليلة عن الدين 🌙 لا توجد إجابة خاطئة."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": {
        "en": "Your future",
        "ar": "مستقبلك"
      },
      "intro": {
        "en": "Let's talk about your future 🏡",
        "ar": "لنتحدث عن مستقبلك 🏡"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": {
        "en": "Your future spouse",
        "ar": "شريك حياتك"
      },
      "intro": {
        "en": "Now tell me about the spouse you hope for 💍",
        "ar": "والآن حدّثني عن شريك الحياة الذي تتمناه 💍"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Deal-breakers",
        "ar": "ما لا تقبله"
      },
      "intro": {
        "en": "Last part: is anything a firm no for you?",
        "ar": "الجزء الأخير: هل هناك شيء مرفوض تمامًا؟"
      }
    }
  ],
  "fields": [
    {
      "key": "name",
      "chapter": 1,
      "input": "text",
      "visibility": "card",
      "question": {
        "en": "What is your name, dear? The name you would like me to call you.",
        "ar": {
          "male": "ما اسمك يا ابني؟ الاسم الذي تحب أن أناديك به.",
          "female": "ما اسمك يا بنتي؟ الاسم الذي تحبين أن أناديك به."
        }
      },
      "why": {
        "en": "So I can talk to you by name. Your name stays hidden from others until you both agree to be introduced.",
        "ar": "حتى أناديك باسمك. يبقى اسمك مخفيًا عن الآخرين حتى توافقا على التعارف."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "age",
      "chapter": 1,
      "input": "number",
      "visibility": "card",
      "question": {
        "en": "How old are you, {name}? Please type your age in years.",
        "ar": {
          "male": "كم عمرك يا {name}؟ اكتب عمرك بالأرقام.",
          "female": "كم عمرك يا {name}؟ اكتبي عمرك بالأرقام."
        }
      },
      "why": {
        "en": "Age is one of the first things families ask about, and it helps me respect the age range each person wants.",
        "ar": "العمر من أول ما تسأل عنه العائلات، ويساعدني على احترام الفئة العمرية التي يريدها كل طرف."
      },
      "invalid": {
        "en": "Please type your age as a number between 18 and 80, for example 29.",
        "ar": "من فضلك اكتب العمر رقمًا بين 18 و80، مثل 29."
      },
      "min": 18,
      "max": 80
    },
    {
      "key": "country",
      "chapter": 1,
      "input": "country",
      "visibility": "card",
      "question": {
        "en": "Are you living in {detected}?",
        "ar": {
